{"synopsis":"Ini adalah legenda tentang Sakura yang nakal bangkit menjadi pahlawan! SMA Fuurin dikenal memiliki nilai tes terendah, dan petarung terkuat. Musim semi ini, Sakura Haruka memutuskan untuk mencapai puncak Fuurin, dan belajar dari alias SMA Fuurin, yaitu ‘Boufuurin’, yang bertindak sebagai perisai pelindung kota dan penduduknya. Sakura bergabung dengan grup ini sebagai anggota, dan pertarungannya untuk melindungi kota dimulai!","alternative_title":"ウィンドブレイカー, Windbreaker, Wind Breaker, Ветролом","author":"Nii Satoru","artist":"Nii Satoru","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"b83c7950-0a3b-4164-bf01-4aef3ebd8461","number":"196","chapter":"196","title":"","date":"2025-10-24","released":"2025-10-24"},{"chapter_id":"9652a106-13a0-4fa3-9906-b68e82989728","number":"195","chapter":"195","title":"","date":"2025-10-17","released":"2025-10-17"},{"chapter_id":"8d53f10c-6bb8-4899-8dc9-c0432fa02ca7","number":"194","chapter":"194","title":"","date":"2025-10-17","released":"2025-10-17"},{"chapter_id":"7604ff42-a346-429a-8315-7cc3e29d4b0d","number":"193","chapter":"193","title":"","date":"2025-10-11","released":"2025-10-11"},{"chapter_id":"acb74465-4ba5-457e-8ff4-11f823f518cf","number":"192","chapter":"192","title":"","date":"2025-10-11","released":"2025-10-11"},{"chapter_id":"41cc2185-115c-411f-9ed7-5c3f603ad631","number":"191","chapter":"191","title":"","date":"2025-10-11","released":"2025-10-11"},{"chapter_id":"4e6c8522-69b6-4186-8c77-205ddc17a57a","number":"190","chapter":"190","title":"","date":"2025-10-11","released":"2025-10-11"},{"chapter_id":"0de8afbc-8358-4ba6-91a8-9e6f2cdcc1a7","number":"189","chapter":"189","title":"","date":"2025-10-11","released":"2025-10-11"},{"chapter_id":"f8646fc0-6950-40a0-baaa-501be57b2b18","number":"188","chapter":"188","title":"","date":"2025-10-11","released":"2025-10-11"},{"chapter_id":"3276e435-f8ac-42f6-ae9a-335b1a94e396","number":"187","chapter":"187","title":"","date":"2025-10-11","released":"2025-10-11"},{"chapter_id":"9a05fe10-54a1-4ce